e price lost up to a cent per unit, which is why the subtotal and discount tests were off.\n\n**Fix:** `to_cents` now converts the amount as text (`Decimal(str(amount))`), multiplies by 100, and rounds to the nearest whole cent, with exact half-cents rounding up. That matches the half-up rounding `ledger/discounts.py` already uses. `Line.cents()` is the only caller, so nothing else needed to change.", "paced_wait_s": 0.0, "params_stripped": [], "params_stripped_requests": 0, "permission_rejections": 0, "read_calls": 5, "replies_ok": 7, "replies_throttled": 0, "requests_cache_read": 61758, "requests_cache_write": 160016, "requests_cost_usd": 0.8453156, "requests_count": 7, "requests_input_uncached": 16, "requests_output": 1641, "reread": false, "rule_order": "none", "rule_prefix": "neither", "run_id": "omp:trig-omp-multistep:claude-opus-5-5:trial9", "run_seed": 1016, "sampling_observed": null, "schedule_index": 197, "score": 1.0, "started_at": "2026-10-20T02:35:14.884046+00:00", "subagent_resumed": false, "subagent_write_calls": 0, "success": true, "t_agent_s": 24.337, "t_checker_s": 0.378, "t_env_setup_s": 0.003, "task": "trig-omp-multistep", "task_calls": 0, "thinking_mode": "default", "thinking_sent": ["adaptive", "adaptive", "adaptive", "adaptive", "adaptive", "adaptive", "adaptive"], "timeout_s": 840, "tmpdir_leaked_dirs": 0, "token_basis": "proxy_measured", "token_basis_main": "estimated", "token_basis_proxy": "proxy_measured", "tokens": 1657, "tokens_cache_read": 61758, "tokens_cache_write": 160016, "tokens_fresh": 1657, "tokens_input_uncached": 16, "tokens_main_cache_read": 61758, "tokens_main_cache_write": 160016, "tokens_main_calls": 7, "tokens_main_input_uncached": 16, "tokens_main_output": 1641, "tokens_output": 1641, "tokens_proxy_cache_read": 61758, "tokens_proxy_cache_write": 160016, "tokens_proxy_calls": 7, "tokens_proxy_input_uncached": 16, "tokens_proxy_output": 1641, "tokens_proxy_reasoning": null, "tokens_reasoning": 0, "trial": 9, "ts_iso": "2026